WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.437 --> 00:00:02.787
Lesson seven. Weather!

2
00:00:03.755 --> 00:00:10.689
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:11.637 --> 00:00:13.316
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.366 --> 00:00:16.363
Today we learn: Weather! Let's go!

5
00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:21.063
Sunny! Say it with me. Sunny!

6
00:00:25.094 --> 00:00:28.460
Rainy! Say it with me. Rainy!

7
00:00:32.474 --> 00:00:35.707
Windy! Say it with me. Windy!

8
00:00:39.678 --> 00:00:43.295
Cloudy! Say it with me. Cloudy!

9
00:00:47.378 --> 00:00:50.845
Hot! Say it with me. Hot!

10
00:00:54.759 --> 00:00:58.092
Cold! Say it with me. Cold!

11
00:01:02.115 --> 00:01:05.365
Stormy! Say it with me. Stormy!

12
00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:12.810
Snowy! Say it with me. Snowy!

13
00:01:16.868 --> 00:01:23.470
Listen. It is sunny today. It was rainy yesterday.

14
00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:28.583
Say it with me. It is sunny today. It was rainy yesterday.

15
00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:38.787
Take your umbrella because today is a rainy day. Sunny days are hot and bright.

16
00:01:38.837 --> 00:01:40.151
I like this story!

17
00:01:41.038 --> 00:01:46.448
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:46.498 --> 00:01:47.648
Windy!

19
00:01:48.492 --> 00:01:53.899
Look! What's the word?

20
00:01:53.949 --> 00:01:55.099
Cold!

21
00:01:55.919 --> 00:02:01.343
Value corner: Gratitude. Saying thank you for what we have makes us feel happy.

22
00:02:01.393 --> 00:02:03.172
I can show gratitude too!

23
00:02:04.152 --> 00:02:11.564
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

24
00:02:11.614 --> 00:02:13.216
Bye-bye, friends!

